flowchart TD
  validate{Check the inputs}:::check
  validate -->|refused| invalid(Refused: an input is missing, malformed or not used by the action):::transform
  validate -->|ok| attach[Attach the change log and the mirror]:::query
  attach --> decide{Read the registry and PostgreSQL, and decide}:::check
  decide -->|refused| refused(Refused: the table, its state or the publication does not allow it, or the source is being deleted):::transform
  decide -->|already| already(Nothing to do):::transform
  decide -->|would| preview[Dry run: record the preview]:::load
  decide -->|act| act[Wait for the ingest lease, check the preview, then spend it and change the registry in one transaction]:::load
  act --> outcome{Result}:::check
  outcome -->|done| done(Done):::transform
  outcome -->|already| already
  outcome -->|busy| busy(Ingest or apply held the lease past the wait; retry):::transform
  decide -->|drain| drain(An open unit must drain first: run ingest, then a new dry run):::transform
  outcome -->|drain| drain
  outcome -->|refused| moved(Refused: no matching preview, or the table changed):::transform
  outcome -->|trigger| trigger[Start the backfill Flight for the added table]:::flight
  trigger --> done
  whois[Look up who started this run]:::query
  audit[Copy the result to the operations database]:::load
  audit --> snapshot[Refresh the operations snapshot, once]:::load
